      "instance_name": "dominant_control_scene",
      "label": "dominant_control_scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting a woman with dark hair and a leather jacket exerting physical control over a woman with red hair, who is restrained and appears vulnerable. The spatial arrangement shows the dark-haired woman positioned behind and above the red-haired woman, with her hand gripping the red-haired woman's neck and the other hand holding her wrist against a wall. The scene conveys a power imbalance and aggressive dominance.",
